ilename or co_flags changed (the generator, coroutine and iterable"] [429 1 "// coroutine bits of co_flags; the others are the IR's own)."] [474 5 "// the constants the instructions index (PY6b's request: test_marshal replaces them)"] [479 5 "// co_consts reads the view's order: each constant replaced where the IR holds it (queue 229)"] [500 6 "// the view's (bytecode_asm.go): the machine runs the IR"] [513 15 "// a new code object (the copy took the original's)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[78 41] [154 27] [160 113] [190 26] [262 24] [267 24] [272 24] [277 24] [282 24] [306 25] [316 24] [323 23] [328 51] [360 27] [480 26] [501 27] [503 58]]} (go/file "funcattrs.go" :imports [])

